#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/row_delete.rst:5
msgid "Delete row from title block"
msgstr "从图框中删除行"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/row_delete.rst:7
msgid ""
"QElectroTech `title block editor`_ only allows deleting `rows`_ of the "
"`title block`_ from `drawing area`_."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech `图框编辑器 <title block editor_>`_ 只允许删除 `图框 <rows_>`_ 的 `图框 <title"
" block_>`_ 从 `绘图区 <drawing area_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/row_delete.rst:10
msgid "Right click on the head from the `row`_ which should be deleted."
msgstr "从 `row <row_>`_ 右键点击头部，应当删除。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/row_delete.rst:11
msgid "Click the option **Delete this row** to delete the selected `row`_."
msgstr "单击选项 **删除此行** 删除选中的 `row <row_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/row_delete.rst:16
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech title block editor, drawing area"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图框编辑器，绘图区域"
